Independent, unofficial experimental HT neural-rendering integration for the
native macOS version of Cyberpunk 2077. Not an NVIDIA product or an official
DLSS 5 SDK integration; not endorsed by NVIDIA, Apple, Valve, or CD PROJEKT RED.
DLSS, NVIDIA, Cyberpunk 2077 and other product names belong to their owners.

This repository includes adaptations of MIT-licensed overlay/rendering code.
The inference runtime is fetched separately from MLX-DLSS (Apache 2.0) and
uses MLX Swift/MLX (MIT). See third_party/README.md and third_party/licenses/.
Upstream license texts and copyright notices are preserved separately.

No NVIDIA binaries, model weights, converted model packages, game files,
saves, or private captures are distributed. Licenses for source code do not
grant rights to model weights or game assets. Users supply their own inputs
under applicable terms. A locally built app containing weights is for local
use and is not an approved redistributable release package.
